---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Accessibility | SDA Home Choices" description="Our commitment to making the SDA Home Choices website accessible, and how to give feedback.">
  <PageHeader
    title="Accessibility"
  />
  <section class="section"><div class="prose">
    <p>Last updated: 30 September 2026</p>

    <p>SDA Home Choices is committed to making this website accessible to as many people as possible, including people with disability. Accessibility matters to us as a specialist in Specialist Disability Accommodation, and we want everyone to be able to find and use the information on this website.</p>

    <h2>Our approach</h2>
    <p>We aim to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 at Level AA. In practice, this means we work towards clear and consistent structure and navigation, sufficient colour contrast for text, text that can be resized, descriptive text for meaningful images, keyboard access to interactive elements, and content that works with common assistive technologies.</p>

    <h2>Ongoing work</h2>
    <p>Accessibility is an ongoing effort. We review the website as we add and update content, and we work to identify and fix issues over time. Some content or features may not yet fully meet our target, and we welcome being told where we can improve.</p>

    <h2>Feedback and contact</h2>
    <p>If you have trouble accessing any part of this website, or you would like information in a different format, please contact us at <a href="mailto:research@sdahomechoices.com.au">research@sdahomechoices.com.au</a>. Please tell us the page or content involved and the problem you experienced, and we will do our best to help and to provide the information you need in a way that works for you.</p>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
